# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore file (context = sangam/)
**/target/**
# per-build output folders (-Dsangam.target=target-<name>, root pom) are build output too
**/target-*/**
!sangam-*/target/sangam-*.jar
!sangam-*/target-*/sangam-*.jar
**/node_modules/**
sangam-ui/**
sdks/dotnet/**/bin/**
sdks/dotnet/**/obj/**
sdks/python/**/.venv/**
sdks/typescript/**/node_modules/**
sdks/php/vendor/**
deploy/airgap/out/**
deploy/compose/data/**
**/.idea/**
**/.vscode/**
**/*.log
